# Auto Payment Reconciliation

Supplier-wise automatic payment reconciliation for ERPNext.

This app adds a Desk page at `auto_payment_reconciliation`, persistent run tracking, supplier-level rows, queue status, allocation previews, and reconciliation using ERPNext's native Payment Reconciliation implementation.

